sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Accountant as 👤 School Accountant (ACC)
    participant WebApp as 🌐 Web SPA (/accountant/billing & /parent/bills)
    participant FinanceCtrl as ⚙️ FinanceController (/api/v1/finance)
    participant BatchSvc as ⚙️ BillingBatchService
    participant FeeSvc as ⚙️ FeeScheduleService
    participant VietQRSvc as 📱 VietQRService
    participant PrismaDB as 💾 PostgreSQL (Prisma DBML)
    actor Parent as 👤 Parent (PAR)
    participant BankApp as 🏦 Banking App (Mobile)
    participant BankGateway as 💳 Napas / VietQR Webhook Gateway

    Note over Accountant,PrismaDB: Monthly Step 1: Batch Student Invoice Calculation with Excused Absence Credit
    Accountant->>WebApp: Trigger Monthly Billing Batch (Month: 9, Year: 2026)
    WebApp->>FinanceCtrl: POST /api/v1/finance/invoices/batch-generate {month: 9, year: 2026}
    FinanceCtrl->>BatchSvc: executeBatchGeneration("sem_01", 9, 2026)

    BatchSvc->>FeeSvc: getActiveLunchRate("year_2026_2027")
    FeeSvc->>PrismaDB: SELECT unit_price_per_meal FROM meal_fee_configs WHERE is_active = true
    PrismaDB-->>FeeSvc: Rate = 35,000 VND / meal
    FeeSvc-->>BatchSvc: 35,000 VND

    loop For each enrolled student (e.g. Student Nguyễn Văn A)
        BatchSvc->>PrismaDB: Count total school lunch days in Month 9
        PrismaDB-->>BatchSvc: 22 planned meal days
        BatchSvc->>PrismaDB: Count excused absences in month 9 (status='absent_excused')
        PrismaDB-->>BatchSvc: 2 excused absence days

        Note over BatchSvc: Planned: 22 days * 35,000 = 770,000 VND<br/>Credit: 2 days * 35,000 = 70,000 VND<br/>Final Payable: 770,000 - 70,000 = 700,000 VND (20 meals)

        BatchSvc->>VietQRSvc: buildDynamicQRCode("bill_1001", "HS00123", 700000)
        VietQRSvc-->>BatchSvc: "vietqr://pay?bin=970422&acc=123456&amt=700000&msg=BILL1001"

        BatchSvc->>PrismaDB: INSERT INTO student_meal_bills (student_id, billing_month, billing_year, planned_meals_count, excused_absence_count, billable_meals_count, unit_price, total_amount, credited_amount, final_payable_amount, status, payment_qr_payload) VALUES ('std_101', 9, 2026, 22, 2, 20, 35000, 770000, 70000, 700000, 'unpaid', 'vietqr://...')
    end

    BatchSvc-->>FinanceCtrl: Batch Summary (Generated 600 bills)
    FinanceCtrl-->>WebApp: 201 Created {generated_count: 600, total_amount: 420000000}
    WebApp-->>Accountant: Display Generated Billing Batch & Send Notifications CTA

    Note over Parent,BankGateway: Monthly Step 2: Parent QR Scan & Automatic Webhook Reconciliation
    Parent->>WebApp: Open Parent Portal /parent/bills on Smartphone
    WebApp->>FinanceCtrl: GET /api/v1/finance/invoices/student/std_101
    FinanceCtrl-->>WebApp: Invoice Details + VietQR Image
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display 700,000 VND (Credited 2 days absent) + VietQR code

    Parent->>BankApp: Scan VietQR with Vietcombank/MBBank App
    BankApp->>BankGateway: Transfer 700,000 VND with Content "BILL1001"
    BankGateway-->>BankApp: Transfer Successful

    Note over BankGateway,PrismaDB: Asynchronous Webhook Notification
    BankGateway->>FinanceCtrl: POST /api/v1/finance/payments/webhook {transaction_id: "TXN998877", content: "BILL1001", amount: 700000, bank: "VCB"}
    FinanceCtrl->>FinanceCtrl: handlePaymentWebhook(...)
    FinanceCtrl->>VietQRSvc: verifyPaymentTransaction("BILL1001", 700000)
    VietQRSvc-->>FinanceCtrl: true (Matches bill_1001)

    FinanceCtrl->>PrismaDB: INSERT INTO meal_payments (bill_id, transaction_code, payment_amount, payment_method, payment_status) VALUES ('bill_1001', 'TXN998877', 700000, 'VIETQR_BANK_TRANSFER', 'COMPLETED')
    FinanceCtrl->>PrismaDB: UPDATE student_meal_bills SET paid_amount = 700000, status = 'paid' WHERE id = 'bill_1001'
    PrismaDB-->>FinanceCtrl: Invoice marked as PAID

    FinanceCtrl-->>BankGateway: 200 OK {received: true}
    FinanceCtrl-->>WebApp: Push WebSocket / Notification to Parent: "Payment Received! Status: PAID"
